Package: linux-trackpad-driver
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, udev, systemd
Description: Linux driver core-init for Apple Magic Trackpad 2 (USB/BT)
 Sends the USB feature-report init sequence (multitouch enable,
 host-click mode, capped polling rate) for Apple Magic Trackpad 2
 (Lightning 05ac:0265/004c:0265, USB-C 05ac:0324/004c:0324) over USB,
 handles Bluetooth single-node attach, hotplug reconnect via udev plus
 systemd, and suspend/resume re-init via a system-sleep hook.
 .
 Ships the ltd binary, udev rules, systemd units (main service,
 reconnect template, resume service, system-sleep hook), and a default
 system config. Units ship disabled: enable explicitly, see README.Debian.
